{
  "name": "Score new Shopify stores from Apify and route hot leads to Sheets and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0a84de00-82f1-5849-9967-f388084bbb80",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## Score new Shopify stores from Apify and route hot leads to Sheets and Slack\n\nShopify app developers, agencies and freelancers who sell to new merchants and want a short, ranked list of fresh stores every morning instead of a raw dump.\n\n### How it works\n1. A **Schedule Trigger** runs daily and **Set your settings** holds your targets.\n2. An **HTTP Request** runs the New Shopify Stores Pre-Launch Radar Actor on Apify (public Certificate Transparency logs, DNS, store metadata).\n3. A saved **cursor** fetches only stores added since the last successful run: none is billed twice.\n4. **Score each store** gives 0\u201310 points: pre-launch, target niche, target country, small catalog, ships abroad, young domain, with the reasons in plain words.\n5. Every store is logged in Google Sheets (updated by domain).\n6. A **Switch** sends hot stores to Slack one by one and bundles warm ones into one digest.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create an Apify account and a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Connect Google Sheets and Slack.\n3. In **Set your settings**, paste your sheet URL and Slack channel, then set your niches and countries.\n4. Run once (sample data is pinned), unpin, activate. Only active runs save the cursor.\n\nApify account (billed per store returned, $0.02 each, after your filters; `maxItems` caps every run), a Google Sheet with a `Stores` tab, a Slack workspace.\n\n### Customization\n- Change the points or add rules in the **Score each store** code.\n- Raise or lower `hotScore` to control how many alerts you get.\n- Swap Slack for email, or Sheets for your CRM.\n\nBusiness-level public data only: no emails, phones or personal names. Not affiliated with Shopify Inc. Disclosure: I built the Apify Actor used here."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3e0b2c51-7a4c-5c31-a134-591378c45aa6",
      "name": "Fetch section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
