        "width": 1000,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## 1. Fetch new stores only\nDaily run, your targets, the saved cursor, then the Apify Actor returns only stores added since the last successful run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8946b217-921d-55b3-b0fa-6c73cc35287f",
